    "['neighbor [parameter1] send-label', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols bgp group internal neighbor 5.5.5.5 family inet labeled-unicast', 'parent_command': ['set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'family inet labeled-unicast'], 'root': 'set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols bgp group internal neighbor 5.5.5.5 family inet labeled-unicast\\n##\\n\\nExplanation: \\n- The Cisco `neighbor x.x.x.x send-label` command enables MPLS label exchange with a BGP neighbor for labeled unicast routes\\n- In Junos, this is configured by enabling the `labeled-unicast` address family for the BGP neighbor\\n- The command assumes the BGP neighbor is already configured in an \"internal\" group (since AS 200 matches the local AS)\\n- The full context would require other BGP configuration elements, but this is the direct equivalent of the send-label functionality', 'trans_template': 'set protocols bgp group internal neighbor 5.5.5.5 family inet labeled-unicast'}]]": 1,
    "['neighbor [parameter1] send-label', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols bgp group external-peers neighbor 10.3.1.1 family inet labeled-unicast', 'parent_command': ['set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'family inet labeled-unicast'], 'root': 'set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols bgp group external-peers neighbor 10.3.1.1 family inet labeled-unicast\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\nThe Cisco command `neighbor 10.3.1.1 send-label` enables BGP labeled unicast (RFC 3107) for the specified neighbor. In Juniper, this is configured by:\\n1. Creating/selecting a BGP group (here I used \"external-peers\" as a placeholder)\\n2. Enabling the `inet labeled-unicast` address family for the specific neighbor\\n3. The Juniper command is more explicit about the address family being enabled', 'trans_template': 'set protocols bgp group external-peers neighbor 10.3.1.1 family inet labeled-unicast'}]]": 1,
